1
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:03,500
KINEMA CITRUS
15TH ANNIVERSARY PRODUCTION

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:08,970
22ND JUNIOR BOXING TOURNAMENT
WOMEN'S MVP AWARD: MARI OTSU

3
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:11,510
[helicopter whirring]

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,970
EPISODE 1 MERMAID PRINCESS LARA

5
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,730
[bell tolling]
[♪ ethereal music]

6
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:19,390
[LUNA] No way!

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,190
I can't believe it!

8
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,060
So this is where
we all come from?

9
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,570
Wow!

10
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,150
I wonder what color
she's going to be.

11
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,530
-Color?
-Wait, I know!

12
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,950
-She's going to be red, right?
-Huh?

13
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,910
She'll be just like me!

14
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,030
She's a blue mermaid!

15
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,490
-She's red!
-She's blue!

16
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,540
[annoyed groaning]

17
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:41,120
Now then, you two, don't forget
Father is watching.

18
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,710
Whatever color she is, she's
still my beautiful daughter.

19
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,130
[Rowan gasps]
- [SISTERS] Ah! Hmm.

20
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:48,420
Time has finally come.

21
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,470
[sisters gasp loudly]

22
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,800
Welcome the arrival of
my 6th princess,

23
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,010
henceforth known as Lara.

24
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:56,680
LARA, 0 YEARS OLD

25
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,730
[baby cooing]
[♪ gentle music playing]

26
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:09,530
Lara, I'm your big sis, Luna.

27
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:15,490
[Luna cries]

28
00:01:16,330 --> 00:01:19,160
[♪ melancholic music]

29
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:22,500
1780 A.D.

30
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,540
[LUNA] Hey, Lara! Stop!
[Lara gnaws]

31
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:26,000
You can't chew on that!

32
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:27,210
Ugh!

33
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:30,050
She's just like you
when you were little, Luna,

34
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:31,090
don't you think?

35
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:32,630
What? No way!

36
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:36,640
[nanny laughs softly]
I've been alive for 1,000 years.

37
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,430
To me, you're all babies.

38
00:01:39,430 --> 00:01:42,730
But at the same time, you're all
noble beings with royal blood.

39
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:45,610
-Noble? Lara too?
-Lara too.

40
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:49,530
Let's not forget, Lara is
one of the Princesses of Light.

41
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:54,490
Uh, Lara, that's from the
statue of our father!

42
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,370
Come on, let go of it right now!

43
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:00,620
You're bored of this
castle, right?

44
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,870
Then let's go on
an adventure!

45
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,670
What do you say?

46
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,960
Hmm?

47
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:08,670
[♪ adventurous music]

48
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:12,220
[giggling]

49
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:16,340
Lord Rowan, I have
reason to believe

50
00:02:16,390 --> 00:02:19,430
that your daughter Lara
might be very special.

51
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:22,560
I sense the same thing
in her that I did in her mother,

52
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,390
her Majesty the late Queen.

53
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,900
It's not just with Lara.

54
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:30,900
Every single one of my
daughters are very special.

55
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:33,360
Of course, that's just for
show though, isn't it?

56
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,240
Surely you wish for
the princess's

57
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,700
revival above everything
else, right?

58
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:41,370
I don't have any interest
in such nonsense.

59
00:02:41,410 --> 00:02:44,660
You know full well that
prophecies are forbidden by law!

60
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:48,090
But then, you are not Nanny.

61
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,210
[Nanny chuckles]

62
00:02:50,250 --> 00:02:53,340
As if I'd even bother trying to
remember every single law.

63
00:02:54,090 --> 00:02:55,470
Hey, Rowan.

64
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:58,140
-The witch!
-Grace, it's you!

65
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:01,390
I just came to visit
my adorable nieces.

66
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,480
You're so cruel for not even
telling me about them.

67
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:07,060
You've already been
banished from this place.

68
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,480
Yet you still enter
my castle illegally?

69
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,440
You know that girl
is special.

70
00:03:11,780 --> 00:03:13,280
It's pointless trying to
bind her

71
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,530
with your
pathetic laws.

72
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:17,320
After all, her light could
become the very blade

73
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,950
that destroys
your castle.

74
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:22,280
You broke the law, and that's
punishable by death!

75
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:24,330
Strike her down, now!

76
00:03:24,370 --> 00:03:25,620
[clanging] [thud]

77
00:03:26,410 --> 00:03:31,500
[evil cackling]
[♪ dramatic music begins]

78
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,260
Are you bored?

79
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:42,720
I thought you'd be
happy to be out.

80
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,640
[magical twinkling]

81
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:48,150
Over there!

82
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:51,060
Wait, did you find something?

83
00:03:54,990 --> 00:03:55,820
[Lara gasps]

84
00:03:57,150 --> 00:04:01,990
Isn't this... This thing
belongs to humans!

85
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:03,120
You shouldn't
hold it!

86
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,200
Throw it away!

87
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,120
Human?

88
00:04:06,450 --> 00:04:09,620
Yeah, they're hideous,
cursed beings.

89
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:12,670
Just touching that thing is
against the law.

90
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,670
[bell tolls]

91
00:04:18,050 --> 00:04:19,260
Good night, Lara.

92
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:21,390
I hope you sleep well.

93
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,690
So strange.

94
00:04:31,350 --> 00:04:33,560
[water bubbling]

95
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,400
[ROWAN] Lara...

96
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,860
1787 A.D.

97
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:39,030
From this moment on,
you are now an official

98
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,360
member of the royal family.

99
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,660
LARA, 10 YEARS OLD

100
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:44,120
Therefore, I bestow
this royal ring

101
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,250
upon our new and
beloved princess.

102
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,370
[Lara gasps softly]

103
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:56,210
By wearing this royal ring,
you now have permission

104
00:04:56,250 --> 00:04:59,130
to swim in seas wider and
farther than ever before.

105
00:04:59,550 --> 00:05:02,380
However, one area is
off-limits.

106
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,850
You must never approach

107
00:05:03,890 --> 00:05:05,430
the human world
that lies above.

108
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:07,430
Humans?

109
00:05:07,470 --> 00:05:09,430
They are hideous and
cursed beings.

110
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:12,060
Whereas we mermaids
have always made sure

111
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:14,520
to live our lives
by the light, we must

112
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,980
protect our light so
it's never defiled

113
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:18,490
by those hideous humans.

114
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:21,610
This is our strongest law.

115
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,660
Lara!

116
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:25,740
So, what was Father
talking to you about?

117
00:05:26,580 --> 00:05:28,580
Stay away from
hideous humans.

118
00:05:29,330 --> 00:05:30,660
There you go, I knew it.

119
00:05:31,370 --> 00:05:33,250
Father sees
right through everything.

120
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,500
But they're so close.

121
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:39,050
They live right by the sea.
I think...

122
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,840
I'd love to see them
even just once.

123
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,800
I've heard that
100 times, you know.

124
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,220
You're a fool.

125
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:46,510
I'm a fool?

126
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,010
No doubt about it.

127
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,390
What do you think would
happen to you

128
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,480
if you met a human?

129
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:55,020
[♪ melancholic music]

130
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,240
Am I really a fool?

131
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:09,450
[♪ music continues]

132
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:18,590
1792 A.D.

133
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,380
Is this?

134
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:23,050
LARA, 15 YEARS OLD

135
00:06:23,090 --> 00:06:24,430
Where is the prince?

136
00:06:24,470 --> 00:06:26,300
We need to find the prince.
Where is he?

137
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:29,310
[Lara gasps]

138
00:06:30,850 --> 00:06:32,140
What should I do?

139
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:33,270
Shall I tell someone?

140
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,640
[gasps]

141
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:37,440
[♪ harp music]

142
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:42,240
[gasps]

143
00:06:55,410 --> 00:06:56,460
Prince!

144
00:06:56,790 --> 00:06:57,790
My prince!

145
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:02,090
[♪ music continues]

146
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,520
Lara!

147
00:07:20,770 --> 00:07:21,650
Lara!

148
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:23,400
Oh, what's up?

149
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:24,650
You tell me.

150
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:28,070
It's no fun around here when
you're feeling down.

151
00:07:28,530 --> 00:07:30,070
But when you're
in a good mood,

152
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,200
you're a real pain.

153
00:07:34,370 --> 00:07:36,500
-Big sis?
-That's me.

154
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:38,580
Humans are-—

155
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:41,540
[rumbling] [water bubbling]

156
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:44,420
Father!

157
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:46,550
Huh? What?

158
00:07:47,090 --> 00:07:48,590
What's going on?

159
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:53,850
I know you have been
bringing back

160
00:07:53,890 --> 00:07:55,600
forbidden human relics
from the land.

161
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:58,390
However, this time
you've done more

162
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:00,270
than breach a few laws.

163
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:02,190
I heard there was sand
and dirt

164
00:08:02,230 --> 00:08:03,650
from the land
in your room.

165
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:06,280
Is this true, Lara?

166
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,860
I have told you time
and time again

167
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:11,070
that you are not to go
near humans.

168
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:16,750
Humans are hideous,
despicable creatures.

169
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:22,380
I don't get it.

170
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:26,550
What are you saying?

171
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:30,130
I wonder if-— well, are humans...

172
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:33,390
really such hideous
creatures after all?

173
00:08:33,430 --> 00:08:34,390
[gasps]

174
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:37,140
[♪ tense music]

175
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:44,360
Why did you speak?

176
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,490
Those words are
far more sinful

177
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,610
than any silence.

178
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:51,610
You are henceforth forbidden to
leave the castle.

179
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:55,580
Until you have seen
100 sunrises.

180
00:08:55,990 --> 00:08:59,040
[♪ dramatic music swells]

181
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:05,420
Oh my, why would I say
that to him?

182
00:09:06,630 --> 00:09:08,970
It looks like your big mouth got
you into trouble.

183
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:11,180
I never thought you'd
have it in you

184
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:12,630
to talk to Rowan like that.

185
00:09:13,930 --> 00:09:14,890
Who are you?

186
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:18,480
She is Lady Grace, the witch.

187
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:21,440
-Lady Witch?
-That's right.

188
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:24,020
I'm also your very loving aunt.

189
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,570
Huh? But I've never
heard of you before.

190
00:09:26,610 --> 00:09:28,030
[Grace scoffs]

191
00:09:28,070 --> 00:09:28,940
Whatever.

192
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,820
I brought you a little
present today.

193
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:32,610
I hope you like it.

194
00:09:32,950 --> 00:09:34,200
A present?

195
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,490
Yes, it's a most
wonderful present.

196
00:09:36,950 --> 00:09:40,330
After all, it has the ability of
granting your most desired wish.

197
00:09:40,830 --> 00:09:42,120
It can do that?

198
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:44,250
Oh yes, this potion
has the ability

199
00:09:44,290 --> 00:09:46,420
to turn mermaids into humans.

200
00:09:48,210 --> 00:09:49,670
You can't say that.

201
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:55,050
Your father, his laws, it's all
so suffocating.

202
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,890
Don't you want to go back
to the land

203
00:09:56,930 --> 00:09:58,180
and see that person again?

204
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:01,520
Isn't that your most
desired wish?

205
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,390
What do you...?

206
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,980
You know, I just adore looking
in this mirror.

207
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,280
It's a magic mirror
that shows you

208
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,280
absolutely anything
you want to see.

209
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,780
I enjoyed it.

210
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:15,200
Your law-breaking conversation
with Rowan...

211
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:18,280
I also thoroughly enjoyed
the look on your face

212
00:10:18,330 --> 00:10:19,910
when you met that human.

213
00:10:19,950 --> 00:10:21,200
[cackles]

214
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:26,290
Oh, so you saw something.

215
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:29,710
This mirror tests the hearts of
those who look into it.

216
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:31,920
It only shattered
because your heart

217
00:10:31,970 --> 00:10:34,260
was so deeply moved
by what you saw.

218
00:10:35,050 --> 00:10:36,220
What did you see in it?

219
00:10:36,470 --> 00:10:38,390
What do you want to see in it?

220
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:41,480
Just what is it exactly
that your heart truly desires?

221
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,440
I'm bored.

222
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:57,570
This potion transcends
the boundary

223
00:10:57,620 --> 00:11:00,410
between human and mermaids,
and is strictly forbidden.

224
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:03,910
And I have no intention
of wasting any of it

225
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,250
on a coward like you.

226
00:11:06,370 --> 00:11:07,580
Enjoy yourself.

227
00:11:08,250 --> 00:11:09,250
[LARA] Wait...

228
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:13,590
You're wrong. I'm not a coward.

229
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:17,510
I'm just... I'm just a fool.

230
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:20,300
Even though I know
I have to listen to him

231
00:11:20,350 --> 00:11:22,760
and obey his voice...
I'm still a fool.

232
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:28,230
[GRACE] Do you know
that we are born twice?

233
00:11:29,190 --> 00:11:31,730
The first time is
merely to exist.

234
00:11:31,770 --> 00:11:33,730
The second time is when we live.

235
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,360
Those are the words
of a certain human.

236
00:11:37,610 --> 00:11:40,700
It's not up to Rowan who
decides, nor is it the true law.

237
00:11:41,450 --> 00:11:44,410
The one who decides...
is you.

238
00:11:53,170 --> 00:11:56,670
Many blessings
to the brave princess.

239
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,470
Goodbye, Lara.

240
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:31,210
[GRACE] If you take this
potion, you can become a human.

241
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:34,630
But you must understand
it's only temporary.

242
00:12:35,210 --> 00:12:37,340
[unintelligible voices]

243
00:12:37,550 --> 00:12:39,550
You must find true love

244
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:43,050
before you vanish completely
like a bubble.

245
00:12:45,010 --> 00:12:46,470
[LARA] I must find true love?

246
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:48,430
[GRACE] True love is different

247
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,560
from standard
romantic feelings.

248
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:53,270
It is like a radiant light
that can be only be born

249
00:12:53,310 --> 00:12:55,230
from very deep
within the heart.

250
00:12:55,650 --> 00:12:56,610
[LARA] You mean...

251
00:12:57,690 --> 00:12:59,700
[GRACE] I'll make sure
you meet the prince.

252
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,160
After that, it's up to you.

253
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:12,130
As payment for my kindness...

254
00:13:12,170 --> 00:13:14,000
I shall be taking your voice.

255
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:15,130
My voice?

256
00:13:15,540 --> 00:13:17,960
The world above is harsh
yet sensitive.

257
00:13:19,050 --> 00:13:21,380
Just like with your father,
a single word

258
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:25,050
in the wrong place can be
enough to get you cast out.

259
00:13:26,970 --> 00:13:28,100
But don't worry.

260
00:13:30,890 --> 00:13:33,560
[laughing]

261
00:13:35,570 --> 00:13:40,650
After all, true love is not
a voice, but light itself.

262
00:13:43,490 --> 00:13:46,240
I want to see it for myself,
the ending

263
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:49,200
of the beautiful story
of the foolish mermaid.

264
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,000
I want to see the true value
of the love that blossoms

265
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:53,630
between a mermaid
and a human!

266
00:13:55,130 --> 00:13:57,380
I want you to prove it to me!

267
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:01,260
Prove, Lara,
that this is true love!

268
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,340
[gasps]

269
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,620
Oh dear,
the tragic heroine, huh?

270
00:14:27,530 --> 00:14:29,410
I'm really bored
with this ending.

271
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:32,120
You were a mermaid all along?

272
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:35,080
Did you really think
you could seduce me

273
00:14:35,330 --> 00:14:37,290
in that repulsive, hideous form?

274
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:42,470
My Lara, you must stay away
from humans.

275
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:48,600
What do you think would happen
to you if you met a human?

276
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:54,770
[LARA] Maybe everyone was right
about humans after all...

277
00:14:56,770 --> 00:15:00,400
But... I'm in love...
with a human.

278
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:05,150
I have...
fallen in love with you.

279
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,370
[gasps]

280
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,000
[laughs]

281
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,170
Father...

282
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:27,260
you said that mermaids
are beautiful...

283
00:15:28,470 --> 00:15:30,350
and that humans are hideous.

284
00:15:31,260 --> 00:15:33,100
But it looks like that
wasn't true.

285
00:15:34,310 --> 00:15:38,440
I guess it's me...
who was hideous.

286
00:16:13,930 --> 00:16:15,180
Oh... What...

287
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,600
What happened?

288
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:21,360
Wait... Didn't I just die?

289
00:16:31,370 --> 00:16:32,700
What is this place?

290
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,000
Isn't that...?

291
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,330
That's my Father's...

292
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,000
Father!

293
00:16:45,590 --> 00:16:46,760
Big sis!

294
00:16:49,130 --> 00:16:50,300
Where are you?!

295
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:54,010
[gasps]

296
00:16:58,270 --> 00:16:59,270
This is...

297
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,320
It's a magic mirror
that shows you

298
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,570
absolutely anything
you want to see.

299
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:11,280
Magic mirror...

300
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:14,660
tell me...
What happened to everyone?!

301
00:17:15,870 --> 00:17:17,330
What did you do to
my daughter?

302
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:20,080
I just offered her a potion.

303
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:23,380
It was your daughter's choice
to take it or not.

304
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:25,590
[screams]

305
00:17:31,130 --> 00:17:33,300
If she goes
into the human world...

306
00:17:34,010 --> 00:17:36,720
I know that if she does,
disaster will strike us all!

307
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:38,640
[gasps]

308
00:17:40,810 --> 00:17:43,140
[MAN] Your Highness!
The castle's light!

309
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:45,400
I've never seen this before!

310
00:17:48,610 --> 00:17:51,570
The law must not be broken,
no matter what.

311
00:17:52,490 --> 00:17:55,240
The royal bloodline
is a cursed bloodline!

312
00:17:58,370 --> 00:18:00,160
The castle is going to fall?

313
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,450
Oh dear.

314
00:18:02,540 --> 00:18:04,920
As you know,
that's none of my business.

315
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:06,080
You're evil.

316
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:07,920
I will never forgive you.

317
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:10,880
However, if things
continue like this...

318
00:18:11,630 --> 00:18:13,340
Well, stop
beating around the bush

319
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:16,140
and tell me what you want...
Rowan.

320
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:19,970
It's time to leave
this old castle behind

321
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:21,310
and find a new home.

322
00:18:22,270 --> 00:18:25,140
And that's why you need my
power, is it not?

323
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:30,190
My power, the power of a witch!

324
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:36,200
[cackles maniacally]

325
00:18:37,490 --> 00:18:39,290
You're an evil witch!

326
00:18:40,990 --> 00:18:44,080
When we finally reach
that distant place...

327
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:48,380
I wonder... just how many years
would've been lost.

328
00:18:50,130 --> 00:18:54,510
Are we all just... destined
to fade away into nothing?

329
00:18:57,220 --> 00:19:01,270
Lara, you will be reborn
one day.

330
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:05,440
The very last light
that remains within me...

331
00:19:05,850 --> 00:19:06,980
I give to you.

332
00:19:08,150 --> 00:19:10,110
It's you, my little princess...

333
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:12,280
who must receive it.

334
00:19:13,230 --> 00:19:15,360
No matter how sinful
you may be...

335
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:17,030
It doesn't matter.

336
00:19:17,410 --> 00:19:18,410
Not one bit.

337
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:22,160
Because I... I still love you.

338
00:19:30,250 --> 00:19:33,670
[crying]

339
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:35,800
It's my fault!

340
00:19:36,590 --> 00:19:38,340
All because I made that wish!

341
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:44,430
Because I want so much
to become... a human.

342
00:19:44,890 --> 00:19:45,980
[sobbing]

343
00:19:47,230 --> 00:19:50,020
I... I'll give up this body.

344
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,530
I'll give up my very life!

345
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:54,650
Please...

346
00:19:56,530 --> 00:19:59,120
Please, just... give them back!

347
00:19:59,870 --> 00:20:00,700
Please.

348
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,490
[sobbing]

349
00:20:05,450 --> 00:20:07,250
[GRACE] Is it true what
you said?

350
00:20:08,210 --> 00:20:09,250
Lara.

351
00:20:10,670 --> 00:20:12,750
It's you!
This is all your fault!

352
00:20:13,130 --> 00:20:14,760
What's that?

353
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,460
You'll find that it's you
who caused all of this.

354
00:20:16,510 --> 00:20:17,630
I know!

355
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,760
Hmm.

356
00:20:22,010 --> 00:20:24,390
Your father and everyone else
aren't dead.

357
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:29,060
They just happen to be all
sound asleep.

358
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:32,230
They gathered the faint light
before they vanished

359
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:34,610
inside their little seashells.

360
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:35,730
And...

361
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:39,360
there's only one being
who can wake them

362
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,570
from their deep slumber.

363
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:43,240
That being is you, Lara.

364
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,660
I will give you a trial.

365
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:48,250
It will be
the most terrifying trial

366
00:20:48,290 --> 00:20:50,000
you've ever faced in your life.

367
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:52,670
But if you're willing
to take it on,

368
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:56,170
then you must break through
to me with your own hands.

369
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:59,800
If you want to save everybody,
then prove to me you're ready!

370
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:02,010
Let me see your story!

371
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:04,430
Show me your story
one more time!

372
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:05,770
Lara!

373
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:09,140
[Lara gasps]

374
00:21:12,230 --> 00:21:13,360
Is that...?

375
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:22,870
[GRACE] Many blessings
to the brave princess.

376
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:25,030
[♪ adventurous music]

377
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:39,630
What is...

378
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:42,180
...this place?

379
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:43,550
2026 A.D. OTSU CITY,
SHIGA PREFECTURE

380
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:45,600
-Hurry up Mari!
-Why?

381
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:47,600
What's with the sudden rush?

382
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:53,230
[♪ epic music]
[Lara screams]

383
00:22:28,010 --> 00:22:29,390
This is the first time we met.

384
00:22:29,850 --> 00:22:31,020
TO BE CONTINUED

385
00:22:31,060 --> 00:22:33,140
[♪ closing music begins]

386
00:22:33,390 --> 00:22:36,350
Translation: Sachiko Takahashi

387
